{"trumpstruth_id": "32428", "truth_social_id": "114994989118495992", "original_url": "https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/114994989118495992", "posted_at_et": "August 8, 2025, 4:18 PM", "posted_at_utc": "2025-08-08T20:18:00+00:00", "text": "It's a long time... 35 years they fought — and now, they're friends... It's a big beautiful honor to welcome everyone to the White House for this very historic peace summit between Armenia and Azerbaijan…\nhttps://www.\nyoutube.com/live/EKHlDnl2tQg?s\ni=hs9WWevG8y7R20Gl\nDonald J. Trump\n@realDonaldTrump\n·\nAugust 8, 2025, 4:14 PM\nOriginal Post\nAs President, my highest aspiration is to bring peace and stability to the world. Today's signing follows our success with India and Pakistan... the Congo and Rwanda... Also, just recently, Thailand and Cambodia... We've saved a lot of lives…", "is_retruth": false, "capture_date_et": "Tuesday, May 12, 2026, 05:05 am EDT", "source": "trumpstruth.org", "scraped_at": "2026-05-15T13:04:42.207236+00:00"}
